WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.408
Today is the first day at a new school. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:10.440
We arrive at the school gate with our grown-up.

3
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:16.536
We go to the office first. The office people know we are new.

4
00:00:16.536 --> 00:00:22.296
We meet our teacher. The teacher shows us our classroom.

5
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:27.696
We find our desk. It has our name on it.

6
00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:35.040
At break time there are more children and more noise. We can find a quiet corner.

7
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.800
If we feel unsure, we can tell the teacher: I am new here.

8
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:47.472
At the end of the day, our grown-up picks us up. First day done.

9
00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:55.680
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

